Description: Go-inspired concurrency primitives for C -- development files
 Development files for libnostrgo: headers under /usr/include/ and
 pkg-config metadata (libnostrgo.pc, with a libgo.pc compatibility
 symlink for one release).

Package: libnostr-json1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nostr JSON interop layer (jansson wrappers for libnostr)
 libnostr-json is the jansson-backed JSON interop layer for libnostr
 (encoding/decoding events, filters and query strings). The library was
 renamed from `nostr_json` per decision D-4; a compatibility symlink
 libnostr_json.so is shipped alongside for one release.

